  "releaseNotes": "### Changes since 0.2.0\n* Fixed #1 \n* Fixed #2 \n* Fixed an issue where CliRunner Specializations would throw an exception when run due to using ``UseShellExecute``. \n* Disabled standard input redirection by default with ``BufferedCommandResult``\n* Removed ``StandardInput`` property and parameter from ``BufferedCommandResult``\n* Added ``StandardError`` property and parameter to ``BufferedCommandResult``\n* Disable ``UseShellExecute`` in Command execution code if Standard Input redirection is enabled",
